## 🔴 BLOCKING — Two deployment gates before 21a/b/c work in staging/prod

1. **APP_ENCRYPTION_KEY** must be present in .env.staging + .env.prod.
   Generate per env: `openssl rand -base64 32`. Add to CREDENTIALS.md
   (gitignored). Komodo Stack restart to pick up new env var. Without
   this, every checkout AND every webhook throws at decrypt time.

2. **EcommerceOrder migration** must run before deploy. Apply via:
   `pnpm --filter @orqafy/db exec prisma migrate deploy` on each env.
   Backfill UPDATE sets tenant_id to the oldest tenant — verify in dev
   that this is acceptable (or run a manual UPDATE first for finer
   assignment). Dev migration was NOT applied during 21c (Docker
   postgres was down — P1001 on localhost:42941). Apply before next
   runtime testing of the checkout flow.

